WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Find Anything gives AI agents observable retrieval across private files.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:25.000
This demo uses seventy fictional records—never customer data.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Find All evaluates every eligible indexed file and paginates the matching set.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Exact citations and coverage show where evidence came from and what was missed.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Live connectors and accounts remain disabled until production security is configured.
